  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "798a51ed-478e-4de9-83a6-48e79e9b17e8",
    "name": "NeoMed",
    "description": "## NedMed-chatgpt API\n\nThis collection covers the core API endpoints for the **NedMed** document management platform. It is organized around two primary resource areas: **Users** and **Documents**.\n\n---\n\n### Users\n\n- Retrieve a list of all registered users.\n    \n\n### Documents\n\nFull CRUD support for documents, along with a rich set of collaborative and management features:\n\n- **Create, Read, Update, Delete** — Create new documents, fetch a single document or your own documents, update content, and delete documents.\n    \n- **File Upload** — Upload files to be associated with documents.\n    \n- **Sharing** — Share documents with other users.\n    \n- **Comments & Suggestions** — Add comments or suggestions to a document.\n    \n- **Version History & Restore** — View the full version history of a document and restore a previous version.\n    \n- **Real-time Presence** — Track active users on a document via presence heartbeat and active user queries.\n    \n- **Export** — Export documents in Markdown format.\n    \n\n---\n\n> **Base URL:** `http://localhost:5000`  \nAll requests target a locally running server. Make sure the server is running before sending requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "37687945"
  },
